    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keane Thompson is delighted to present this superb three-bedroom end-of-terrace family home to the market, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after and mature Palmer Park development. Boasting bright, well-proportioned accommodation and a private west-facing rear garden, this attractive home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families and investors alike.\r\n\r\nPresented in well maintained condition throughout, the accommodation is both well-proportioned and practical. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a fitted kitchen with a range of eye and base level units. To the rear, the bright living room enjoys views over the garden and features a fireplace with gas inset, creating a warm and inviting living space. The ground floor also benefits from a modern bathroom with walk-in shower and access to the side garage lean to, currently utilised as a useful storage area. Upstairs comprises three well-appointed bedrooms, including two double bedrooms and a single bedroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the private west-facing rear garden is a wonderful feature of the property, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing in the afternoon and evening sunshine. The garden is laid in lawn with mature hedging and a patio area, is not overlooked and offers a private and tranquil outdoor retreat.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a wonderful family home in a super location.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nPalmer Park is a mature and highly regarded residential development in the heart of Rathfarnham, offering a peaceful, family-friendly setting with every convenience on your doorstep. The property is within easy reach of Rathfarnham Village, Nutgrove Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local amenities nearby.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by highly regarded primary and secondary schools, while Marlay Park, St. Enda's Park and Rathfarnham Castle provide superb recreational facilities. Excellent public transport links and close proximity to the M50 ensure easy access to Dublin City Centre, Sandyford, Leopardstown and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n70.9 Sqm Approx, please refer to floorplans \r\n\r\nHallway\r\nWood flooring, alarm, understairs storage. \r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nRange of eye and base level units, ceramic floor tiles, boiler, recessed lighting.  \r\n\r\nLiving room\r\nWood flooring, tv point, feature fireplace with gas inset and marble surround. \r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nFully tiled, wash hand basin, WC, heated towel rail, walk-in shower with electric Triton. \r\n\r\nUpstairs \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nDouble front facing bedroom, carpet floor, fitted and built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble rear facing bedroom, carpet floor, built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nSingle rear facing bedroom, carpet floor, fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nRear garden\r\nWest facing aspect, laid in lawn and patio area, not overlooked.  \r\n\r\nFront garden\r\nLaid with lawn, side entrance, steps to entrance. \r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n•\tSuperb three-bedroom end of terrace home\r\n•\tWest facing and private rear garden\r\n•\tAlarm\r\n•\tAmple parking and facing a large green\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows\r\n•\tExcellent transport links including the M50\r\n•\tClose to Marlay Park, Nutgrove and Rathfarnham Shopping Centres and an excellent range of local amenities"
      },
      {
